從，為舍人，起橫陽。從攻安陽、杠里，擊趙賁軍於開封，及擊楊熊曲遇、陽武，斬首十二級，賜爵卿。從至霸上。沛公立為漢王，漢王賜寬封號共德君。從入漢中，遷為右騎將。從定三秦，賜食邑雕陰。從擊項籍，待懷，賜爵通德侯。從擊項冠、周蘭、龍且，所將卒斬騎將一人敖下，益食邑。"}],"rationale":"依傅寬、靳歙、周緤分段敘事及明示姓名定位；楚王信與平城下韓信分存，單稱參勃哙敞不補姓，兩位信武侯分持有人，周昌不按同名跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p001","text":"陽陵侯傅寬，以魏五大夫騎將從，為舍人，起橫陽。從攻安陽、杠里，擊趙賁軍於開封，及擊楊熊曲遇、陽武，斬首十二級，賜爵卿。從至霸上。沛公立為漢王，漢王賜寬封號共德君。從入漢中，遷為右騎將。從定三秦，賜食邑雕陰。從擊項籍，待懷，賜爵通德侯。從擊項冠、周蘭、龍且，所將卒斬騎將一人敖下，益食邑。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"陽陵侯","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"傅寬","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"趙賁","kind":"person","person_id":"hpy_6lu_tc5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"楊熊","kind":"person","person_id":"6ek_pen_a4x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"5kd_jn4_se8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"5kd_jn4_se8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"5kd_jn4_se8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"寬","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"nrp_vv5_hry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"項冠","kind":"person","person_id":"63o_61u_6tf"